summary:
  The widget starts its MPRIS bridge without --ms-seq.

history:
  mpris.py counts 1, 2, 3 unless it is asked for moments, so that a 2026.39
  widget starting the new file keeps numbers its int can hold. This widget's
  gate refuses any line more than ten seconds older than the clock, and a
  count of 1 is fifty years old: every key would be dropped.

target:
  package/contents/ui/MprisCommandGate.qml

find:
                 + PodcastLogic.shQuote(stateFile) + " " + PodcastLogic.shQuote(cmdFile) + " --ms-seq";

replace:
                 + PodcastLogic.shQuote(stateFile) + " " + PodcastLogic.shQuote(cmdFile);

expect:
  Killed by tests/test_invariants.py::test_the_widget_starts_its_bridge_asking_for_moments,
  which the gate reaches before tests/qml/tst_mpriscommandgate.qml::test_the_bridge_is_started_asking_for_moments.
  Line-neutral.
